          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They arrived once again in Jerusalem. As Jesus was walking in the Temple, the chief priests, the teachers of the Law, and the elders came to him ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.27",
