              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They started to argue among themselves: “What shall we say? If we answer, ‘From God,’ he will say, ‘Why, then, did you not believe John?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.31",
